# Build artefacts - never commit these.
# The .ko is kernel-version specific: it only loads on the exact kernel it was
# built against, so committing it is actively misleading. Rebuild instead.
*.ko
*.o
*.mod
*.mod.c
.*.cmd
.*.o.cmd
modules.order
Module.symvers
.tmp_versions/

# Runtime state
fanctl.conf
*.log

# Editor noise
*~
.*.swp
